## Documentation Requirements
- Generate **process fiches** (process sheets) with all metadata
- Export **procedure manuals** with diagrams
- Create **visual process maps** showing all levels
- Maintain **glossary** of terms and symbols
- Provide **user guides** for process modeling

## Quality Assurance
- Validate diagram completeness (no missing connections)
- Check for logical errors (infinite loops, unreachable nodes)
- Verify RACI assignments (every activity has R and A)
- Ensure all indicators have targets and measurement methods
- Confirm risk assessments are up-to-date
- Review document references for accuracy

## Reporting & Analytics
- Process execution time analysis
- Bottleneck identification
- Actor workload distribution
- KPI dashboard with trend analysis
- Risk heat maps
- Compliance tracking

